        "TileImage": "$($repository bf60280b-9b3b-4837-a90e-8cbcfe46d515).Image",
        "Description": "Hello Daddy 47,\r\rOur client entered into a deal with these two, from the sounds of it, Lee was to lose the race and our client would win their gamble. However, it seems things may have gone awry. You see last night, the day before the race, an unknown player entered the scene with deep pockets. Our client has his own reasons to distrust them, you know what to do.\r\rP.S. Sierra seems like shes on a power trip, bonus points if u disqualify her to take her down a peg.",
